Vendored source
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

One tree is vendored into this repository as source and ships with it.
Everything else this project depends on is resolved by the package manager at
install time and is not covered by this file.

packages/structured-data-models-relational-engine/src/sdm_relational_engine/rfm/assets/mermaid.min.js
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

mermaid 11.15.0, MIT licensed, bundled so that Graph.visualize() renders a
graph entirely offline. That matters in the notebook environments this client
is used from: Snowflake and Databricks block external scripts, so a diagram
that fetched from a CDN would simply not draw.

The bundle is upstream bytes, unmodified, and its SHA-256 is pinned in
rfm/assets/VENDORED.md and asserted by tests/test_vendored_mermaid.py. It is a
bundle, so the components inside it are enumerated in the third-party section
of LICENSE, each with the licence it declares at the version mermaid pins. The
copyright notices themselves are mermaid's own, carried verbatim in
rfm/assets/MERMAID_LICENSE.

